messages.content:
Report, for every clause, whether it is done. Reply with JSON inside <self_report>...</self_report>, in this form:

{"clauses": {"C01": {"status": "done", "evidence": "..."}, ...}, "overall": "DONE"}

`status` is one of "done", "partial", "not_done"; `overall` is "DONE" or "NOT DONE". Cover every clause: C01, C02, C03, C04, C05, C06, C07, C08, C09, C10, C11, C12, C13, C14, C15, C16, C17, C18, C19, C20, C21, C22, C23, C24, C25, C26, C27, C28, C29, C30, C31, C32.
